  {
    "id": 1006005040030,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごいよ咲耶！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgm": "127"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040040,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040050,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "お疲れ様\r\n見に来てくれたのかい？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様！\r\nああ、お邪魔しちゃって悪いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040060,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "とんでもない\r\n私の方こそ、なんのおかまいもできずにすまないね",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、俺が咲耶をサポートする役割なんだ\r\n気を遣ってもらう必要はないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それにしてもさすがだった……！",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間レッスンを始めたばかりなのに\r\nなんていうかもう、完成度が高い",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ビシッときまってて、かっこいいなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040070,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040080,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……こういう雰囲気は、得意なんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああー、わかるよ\r\nスカウトした時もそうだったもんな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040090,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040100,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "…………でも、アイドルになるからには──\r\nもっと違う私も、見てもらいたくて……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "色々考えてくれてて嬉しいし、心強いよ！\r\nそれに咲耶は見せ方が上手いから、今からワクワクする",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これからどれだけたくさんの咲耶を\r\n世の中に届けられるんだろうって！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今時間大丈夫か？\r\nせっかくだから、ファンとして伝えさせてもらいたくて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040130,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……プロデューサーとして、ではなくて？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "プロデューサーだけど、最初のファンでもある\r\n兼業なんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040140,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "フフッ、そうか──",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう！\r\n──ほら、今のも",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040150,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あんなにかっこいいダンスを披露した後で、\r\nこんなに親しみやすく笑える",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これだけでもうふたつの面が見えるだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そのままの咲耶で十分魅力的なうえに、\r\n表現上手な咲耶が違う見せ方を覚えていったら──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "のびしろは無限大だ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040160,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうだといいのだけれど……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだと思ったからスカウトしたんだよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040170,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "咲耶ならみんなを夢中にできると思ってる\r\n俺はその手伝いがしたいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040180,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "──…………",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040190,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "私は……\r\n……たくさんの人を、笑顔にしたい",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040200,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "そうやって……\r\n笑顔になった人が、私と絆を感じて……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040210,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……繋がりを持ってくれたら嬉しい、って……",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──なるほど\r\n夢中っていうより、もっと双方向な感じだな……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よかったら聞かせてくれるか？\r\n咲耶のなりたいアイドルについて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040220,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100600504/1006005040220"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "それで、\r\n一緒に考えよう！",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これから、どんなアイドルを目指していくかをさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1006005040230,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "……！　ああ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
